            {
               "text": "### Prerequisites\n\nThe game on this page helps reinforce the comparisons studied in the previous texts. When we compare two things, they can be exactly **equal**, belong to the **same group** without being exactly equal, or be completely **different**. Before starting, we recommend reading the following texts first:\n\n- **On Equality**: the concept of equality (<htcite0>).\n- **Classifying equality**: when things belong to the same group but are not exactly equal (<htcite1>).",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "bb226b7f-2358-437f-b6e1-668943c682d7",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "On Equality",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
