            {
               "text": "<p><center><div class=\"compGame\"><p id=\"compLevelTitle\" class=\"compLevel\"></p><div class=\"compItems\"><div id=\"compItem1\" class=\"compFigureSlot\"></div><div id=\"compItem2\" class=\"compFigureSlot\"></div></div><div class=\"compButtons\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"compBtnEqual\" class=\"compButton compEqual\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-equals\"></i> <span>Equal</span></button><button type=\"button\" id=\"compBtnGroup\" class=\"compButton compGroup\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-object-group\"></i> <span>Same group</span></button><button type=\"button\" id=\"compBtnNeither\" class=\"compButton compNeither\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-ban\"></i> <span>Neither</span></button></div><div class=\"compFeedback\"><p id=\"compMsgCorrect\" class=\"compMsg compMsgCorrect\" style=\"display: none;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\"></i> Correct!</p><p id=\"compMsgWrong\" class=\"compMsg compMsgWrong\" style=\"display: none;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i> Not quite, try again.</p><p id=\"compMsgLevelComplete\" class=\"compMsg compMsgFinish\" style=\"display: none;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-medal\"></i> Level complete!</p><p id=\"compMsgGameComplete\" class=\"compMsg compMsgFinish\" style=\"display: none;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-medal\"></i> Game complete! Congratulations!</p></div><p id=\"compProgress\" class=\"compProgress\"></p><p id=\"compScoreText\" class=\"compScore\"></p><p><button type=\"button\" id=\"compNextLevel\" class=\"compNext\" style=\"display: none;\"></button> <button type=\"button\" id=\"compRestart\" class=\"compNext\"></button></p><div style=\"display: none;\"><span id=\"compWordLevel\">Level</span><span id=\"compWordQuestion\">Question</span><span id=\"compWordOf\">of</span><span id=\"compWordScore\">Score</span><span id=\"compWordNextLevel\">Next level</span><span id=\"compWordRestart\">Restart</span><span id=\"compWordPlayAgain\">Play again</span><span id=\"compWordLevel1\">Numbers from 0 to 9</span><span id=\"compWordLevel2\">Numbers from 10 to 1,000,000</span><span id=\"compWordLevel3\">Maya numbers</span><span id=\"compWordLevel4\">Numbers, circles and squares</span><span id=\"compWordLevel5\">Numbers, circles and squares</span><span id=\"compWordLevel6\">Numbers, circles and squares</span><span id=\"compWordLevel7\">Egypt, Mesoamerica and pyramids</span></div></div></center></p>",
